Package: surveyBurden
Title: Ex-Ante Path-Aware Survey Instrument Burden Assessment
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Peter", "King", , "p.king1@leeds.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8550-466X"))
Description: Estimates the response burden of a Qualtrics survey instrument
    before it is fielded. Parses a '.qsf' export (or fetches a live survey
    through the Qualtrics API), reconstructs the respondent paths the
    survey's flow and display logic allow, scores every question with the
    GfS points scheme (Heimgartner and Axhausen 2024)
    <doi:10.32866/001c.121624>, and reports the burden across those paths
    as a structured object.
